bel pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Body Equipment<br/>Amulets and Necklaces</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"duration\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Duration</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">30 minutes</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.94<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">May 31, 2016<br/>Summer Update 2016</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20160423124830&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Collar_of_Green_Plasma_03af11.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a collar of green plasma <span class=\"p-attributes\">(magic level +3, faster Regeneration)</span> <span class=\"p-duration\">that is brand-new</span>.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by sorcerers and druids of level 150 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 5.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Increases your Mana and Hitpoints Regeneration for 30 minutes by the rate of 2 HP and 8 MP per 6 seconds, which means it recover 2400 MP and 600 HP in total. Similar to rings, and different from most amulets, this collar can  be equipped/unequipped in smart mode using an action button of the action bars. It can be sold for the full price to the NPC even if used, as long as it does not disappear when used completely. <br/>Can also look like:<br/> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Collar of Green Plasma (Activated)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Collar_of_Green_Plasma_Activated_2ffc12.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ahau\">Ahau</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Alptramun\">Alptramun</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Anomaly\">Anomaly</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Arachnophobica\">Arachnophobica</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brain%20Squid\">Brain Squid</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Breach%20Brood\">Breach Brood</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Burster\">Burster</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Count%20Vlarkorth\">Count Vlarkorth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dread%20Intruder\">Dread Intruder</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dreadful%20Disruptor\">Dreadful Disruptor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Duke%20Krule\">Duke Krule</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Earl%20Osam\">Earl Osam</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Eradicator\">Eradicator</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Izcandar%20Champion%20of%20Winter\">Izcandar Champion of Winter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Izcandar%20the%20Banished\">Izcandar the Banished</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/King%20Zelos\">King Zelos</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lord%20Azaram\">Lord Azaram</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Malofur%20Mangrinder\">Malofur Mangrinder</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Maxxenius\">Maxxenius</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Outburst\">Outburst</a></li>\n